sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Core API (rag_client)
    participant M as RAG main (/generate)
    participant RT as road_type resolver
    participant RE as retrieval
    participant C as Chroma
    participant G as generation
    participant H as Hugging Face
    participant CG as citation_guard

    API->>M: {lat, lon, score, road_type?}
    M->>RT: resolve road type
    RT-->>M: road_type + target_office
    M->>RE: query(road_type, score)
    RE->>C: similarity search, k = 5
    C-->>RE: chunks + scores
    RE-->>M: chunks ≥ MIN_SIMILARITY
    alt No relevant chunk
        M-->>API: "not enough rules" fallback sheet
    else Chunks found
        M->>G: build prompt (cite rule_id mandatory)
        G->>H: primary model Llama 3.1 8B
        alt timeout / error
            G->>H: backup model Qwen 2.5 72B
        end
        H-->>G: draft text
        G->>CG: validate citations ⊆ retrieved ids
        alt invalid
            CG-->>G: reject
            G-->>M: deterministic template sheet
        else valid
            CG-->>G: OK
            G-->>M: sheet_text + rule_citations
        end
        M-->>API: GenerateResponse
    end
